{
  "schemaVersion": "ride-output-v2.2.0",
  "label": {
    "text": "总距离 31.1 公里的骑行，移动时长 1 小时 2 分钟",
    "conclusionType": "fact",
    "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:metric.distanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:timing.movingDurationS"]
  },
  "overallAssessment": {
    "text": "本次可用数据有限，但基于现有数据，这是一次以平路为主的骑行，平均心率 168 bpm，高强度区间占比 78%，整体强度较高。",
    "conclusionType": "fact",
    "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:terrain.trendFlatDistanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heart_rate.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heartRate.zone.highIntensityCombined"]
  },
  "highlights": [
    {
      "text": "在 48 分钟的平路区间中，平均速度达到 29.29 km/h，心率平均 174 bpm，展现出持续的较高强度输出。",
      "conclusionType": "fact",
      "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.terrain.terrain-flat-6846.2-31056.1.span", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.terrain.terrain-flat-6846.2-31056.1.speed.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.terrain.terrain-flat-6846.2-31056.1.heart_rate.mean"]
    }
  ],
  "dimensions": [
    {
      "dimensionId": "pacingExecution",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "text": "本次骑行总距离 31.1 公里，移动时长 1 小时 2 分钟，总用时 1 小时 6 分钟，途中停车 1 次。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:metric.distanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:timing.movingDurationS", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:metric.elapsedDurationS", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:stops.count"]
        },
        {
          "text": "平均速度 28.47 km/h，但部分数据缺失，速度稳定性无法完整评估；整体配速在平路段表现较高。",
          "conclusionType": "interpretation",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:speed.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.terrain.terrain-flat-6846.2-31056.1.speed.mean"]
        },
        {
          "text": "巡航段中，第一个巡航段（2 分钟）平均速度 29.97 km/h，心率 159 bpm；第二个巡航段（2 分钟）平均速度 27.96 km/h，心率 174 bpm；第三个巡航段（3 分钟）平均速度 29.23 km/h，心率 175 bpm。巡航段速度与心率呈现同步变化。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-0-637.span", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-0-637.speed.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-0-637.heart_rate.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-1-2102.span", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-1-2102.speed.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-1-2102.heart_rate.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-2-2334.span", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-2-2334.speed.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-2-2334.heart_rate.mean"]
        },
        {
          "text": "地形方面，平路距离 29 公里，下坡距离 1.6 公里，爬升距离 0 公里；地形分类覆盖率为 100%。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:terrain.trendFlatDistanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:terrain.trendDescentDistanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:terrain.trendClimbDistanceM", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:terrain.classifiedCoverageRatio"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dimensionId": "heartRateLoad",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "text": "平均心率 168 bpm（部分数据缺失），心率区间分布：Z1 占 2%，Z2 占 4%，Z3 占 15%，Z4 占 58%，Z5 占 21%，高强度区间（Z4-Z5）合计占 78%。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heart_rate.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heartRate.zone.z1", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heartRate.zone.z2", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heartRate.zone.z3", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heartRate.zone.z4", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heartRate.zone.z5", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heartRate.zone.highIntensityCombined"]
        },
        {
          "text": "心率在骑行过程中整体处于较高水平，大部分时间处于 Z4 区间，表明本次骑行对心肺系统提出了较高要求。",
          "conclusionType": "interpretation",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heartRate.zone.z4", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heartRate.zone.highIntensityCombined"]
        },
        {
          "text": "巡航段心率从 159 bpm 升至 174-175 bpm，平路长段心率平均 174 bpm，下坡段心率降至 127 bpm，心率随地形和速度变化而波动。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-0-637.heart_rate.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-1-2102.heart_rate.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-2-2334.heart_rate.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.terrain.terrain-flat-6846.2-31056.1.heart_rate.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.terrain.terrain-descent-412.8-2022.7.heart_rate.mean"]
        },
        {
          "text": "速度与心率在同一时间窗口内的同步覆盖率为 100%（基于 123 个固定窗口聚合），代表性窗口的同步覆盖率分别为 70%、100%、100%。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:relation.fixed.speed-heart_rate.aggregate", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:relation.fixed.speed-heart_rate.rep.1", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:relation.fixed.speed-heart_rate.rep.2", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:relation.fixed.speed-heart_rate.rep.3"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dimensionId": "cadenceStrategy",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "text": "平均踏频 79 rpm（部分数据缺失），踏频区间分布：零踏频占 6%，低踏频占 6%，稳定踏频占 7%，耐力踏频占 48%，高踏频占 33%。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.zone.zero", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.zone.low", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.zone.steady", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.zone.endurance", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.zone.high"]
        },
        {
          "text": "巡航段踏频从 82 rpm 升至 88 rpm，平路长段踏频平均 83 rpm，下坡段踏频降至 49 rpm，踏频与地形变化相伴。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-0-637.cadence.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-1-2102.cadence.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.cruise.cruise-2-2334.cadence.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.terrain.terrain-flat-6846.2-31056.1.cadence.mean", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:segment.terrain.terrain-descent-412.8-2022.7.cadence.mean"]
        },
        {
          "text": "整体踏频以耐力区间为主，占比 48%，高踏频区间占比 33%，表明骑行节奏偏重于耐力型。",
          "conclusionType": "interpretation",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.zone.endurance", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.zone.high"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dimensionId": "crossSensorCoordination",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "text": "速度与心率在同一时间窗口内的同步覆盖率聚合值为 100%（基于 123 个固定窗口），代表性窗口的同步覆盖率分别为 70%、100%、100%。",
          "conclusionType": "fact",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:relation.fixed.speed-heart_rate.aggregate", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:relation.fixed.speed-heart_rate.rep.1", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:relation.fixed.speed-heart_rate.rep.2", "claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:relation.fixed.speed-heart_rate.rep.3"]
        },
        {
          "text": "速度与心率在大部分时间窗口内同步出现，表明两者变化具有较高的一致性。",
          "conclusionType": "interpretation",
          "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:relation.fixed.speed-heart_rate.aggregate"]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "suggestions": [
    {
      "text": "下次骑行可尝试在平路段保持稳定的踏频输出，例如维持在 80-90 rpm 区间，以优化骑行效率。",
      "conclusionType": "suggestion",
      "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:cadence.mean"],
      "riskNote": "踏频建议基于本次平均踏频，但功率数据缺失，无法评估效率变化。"
    },
    {
      "text": "鉴于本次高强度心率区间占比较高，建议后续骑行适当安排恢复性低强度骑行，以促进恢复。",
      "conclusionType": "suggestion",
      "claimIds": ["claim:demo-ride-2026-08-20:v2:heartRate.zone.highIntensityCombined"],
      "riskNote": "恢复建议基于本次心率负荷，但未评估长期负荷。"
    }
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "speedStability:CONTINUITY_GAP",
    "relation.fixed.speed-heart_rate.aggregate:AGGREGATED_FROM_123_WINDOWS",
    "power:SERIES_MISSING"
  ]
}
